  "description": "DisCatSharp Interactivity Extension\n\n\t\t\tUnleash the full power of discord commands.\n\n\t\t\tDocumentation: https://docs.dcs.aitsys.dev/articles/modules/interactivity.html",
  "iconFile": "logo-pride.png",
